{title: Happy Day}
{key: C}

{comment: Verse 1}
[C]The greatest day in history,
[F]Death is beaten, you have rescued me,
[Am]Sing it out, Jesus is al[F]ive!
[C]The empty cross, the empty grave,
[F]Life eternal, you have won the day,
[Am]Shout it out, Jesus is [F]alive!
[G]He's alive!

{comment: Chorus}
[C]Oh, happy [F]day, happy [Am]day,
[G]You washed my sin away
[C]Oh, happy [F]day, happy [Am]day,
[G]I'll never be the [C]same[F][Am]
[G]Forever I am changed

{comment: Verse 2}
[C]When I stand in that place,
[F]Free at last, meeting face to face,
[Am]I am yours, Jesus you are m[F]ine.
[C]Endless joy, perfect peace,
[F]Earthly pain finally will cease
[Am]Celebrate, Jesus [F]is alive,
[G]He's alive!

{comment: Bridge}
[Am]Oh, what a glorious [Em]day
What a glorious [F]way
[C]That you have saved me!
[Am]Oh, what a glorious [Em]day
What a glorious [F]name[C]
